          ],
          "content": "Proportional Reasoning-1"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.087,
            0.849,
            0.144
          ],
          "content": "7. Let us draw some human figures. Measure your friend’s body—the lengths of their head, torso, arms, and legs. Write the ratios as mentioned below—"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.262,
